      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TANGO RHYTHM (6) is the one to beat again after a strong win over this track and distance last time out, making it a hat-trick of wins here. She cops another good gate, and an extra 1.5kg will not be enough to stop her from winning again. SOLAR SYSTEM (1) fought hard to score by a nose here last start and in a similar field, bar the top pick, he will carry less weight after a clever 3 kg claim. Stick with him. SOARING SOLO (7) showed plenty of determination to win by a neck 3 starts ago and though his next couple of starts have been plain, he could still take some pegging back. SHE IS ALL MAGIC (10) has collected 2 placings from 6 runs this prep and did not get any favours when bottled away on the inside here last time. She can bounce back into the top 4 here. WESTERN IMPACT (5) hit the line strongly to go down by just under a length here last start and should be steaming home again. Include in all top 4 combos to be safe.",
